# Hartree-Fock single point on water, the default `scf` workflow.
#
# The `protocol` ladder is the idiomatic choice for scf/response: the SCF is
# solved at 1e-4 and the solution is used to start 1e-6.  Correlated (mp2/cc2)
# and oep decks must instead fix `k` -- see cc2_he_corr for why.
#
# Run:   ./run.sh          (or: madqc --wf=scf scf_h2o_hf.in)

dft
    xc          hf
    protocol    [1e-4, 1e-6]
    dconv       1e-4
end

molecule
    eprec   1e-6
    units   atomic
    O   0.0             0.0             0.0
    H   0.0             1.421178283    -1.064386617
    H   0.0            -1.421178283    -1.064386617
end
